wine-sg (10.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Multi-user hardening and features (Stained Glass patches 0014-0025):
    - clients open/create/delete/rename/reopen/chmod files with their own Unix
      rights; per-user process agent for cross-uid ptrace/signal (D14/D16/D19).
    - only SYSTEM mints administrator tokens; owners open their own processes
      (D17/D18); per-user SID names (D12); USERPROFILE ordering (D15).
    - registry: enforce a key's DACL on subkey creation (S2 clause 3); read the
      graphics driver and machine Group Policy (SHRestricted) from HKLM.
    - "Run as administrator" routes to the elevation broker.

